<v Daniel>And what about that massive drop in re-referrals for the very high risk group? That was the most impressive stat you cited.</v>

95
00:11:35.138 --> 00:11:43.002
<v Maya>Right, so if you isolate just the very high group's re-referral estimate, it is actually not statistically significant on its own.</v>

