00:11:43.283 --> 00:11:43.703
<v Daniel>Wait, really?</v>

97
00:11:43.943 --> 00:11:58.691
<v Maya>Yeah. It's a 0.19 standard deviation drop, but the p-value is 0.14. That means there's a 14% chance that specific isolated drop was just random noise. Also, treated children were more often</v>

98
