<v Maya>recorded as white, though the researchers' statistical analysis does control for this. And finally, this is currently a working paper, meaning it is still making its way through the formal peer review process.</v>

99
00:12:11.100 --> 00:12:22.710
<v Daniel>Good to know. But I want to zoom in on one specific finding in this paper that is arguably the weakest statistically, but easily the most fascinating conceptually. It's the 19 investigator result.</v>

